# ============================================================================
# Synthetic test fixtures
#
# Created on the fly to exercise specific rules (cross-001, layer-3, etc.).
# These directories are parsed by the audit like any other source, so they
# MUST be ignored — otherwise a `--repo .` run reports findings that have
# nothing to do with the real codebase.
#
# Convention: `_<area>_test/` for fixture dirs, `_<area>_*.txt` for captured
# run output. Delete the directory after each test run; do not commit.
# ============================================================================
_l3_test/
_l3_*.txt
_cross_test/
_cross_*.txt
_day4_test/
_day4_*.txt

